# The tools write their volumes into --out alongside the reports. Keep the
# CSV/JSON/PNG results, never the NIfTIs: brain masks are small but the prepared
# volumes and warped outputs run to hundreds of MB each, and all of them are
# reproducible from the raw data.
*.nii
*.nii.gz

# The root .gitignore excludes *.mat for the MATLAB reconstruction outputs, which
# also swallows the ANTs transforms. Those are ~130 bytes and are what let
# lr_inspect.py align planes without re-running the registration, so keep them.
!*GenericAffine.mat
